commit it was taken from, and the modifications made to it.

term-server's screen-based agent detection engine (src/detect/) is an
independent implementation written for this project. It reads the manifest
format above, and the design of that format — priority-ordered rules, structural
screen regions, nested any/all/not matchers, and the deliberate idle fallback —
originates with herdr. The engine code itself is not derived from herdr's source
and is covered by term-server's MIT License.
